    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seal is broken, revealing the hidden castle of the Succubus Queen in the desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers from all over rush toward the desert castle, seeking the Succubus Queen's buried treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As various adventurers head for the treasure, the player takes on the role of a futanari imp\u2014a lust demon\u2014fighting humans to protect the treasure of her master, the Succubus Queen Mardic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the imp and defeat enemies aiming for the Succubus Queen's treasure!<br>Use direct attacks, magic, and even masturbation-based semen attacks!<br>Defeat enemies to punish them! But beware\u2014enemies will also target the imp's body!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D side-scrolling action game combining magic and combat elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D animation for smooth character motion, vividly depicting both battles and H-scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing to enemies, specific events and animations can be viewed in a memory/replay mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels are available, including an Easy mode suitable for beginners.</p></li></ul>",
